{"id":"n55527-1-6","stage":2,"title":"메모지 · 便签纸","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55527-1-6-1","ko":"메모지 한 장만 주실 수 있어요?","zh":"能给我一张便签纸吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"메모지","meaning":"便签纸，便笺","explanation":"메모지：便签纸，便笺。","readings":[{"term":"메모지","audio":"/audio/7de567c19a8f64b2a3c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55527","senseId":"1","lemma":"메모지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"메모지","audio":"/audio/7de567c19a8f64b2a3c3.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个","explanation":"한：一个。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"2","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"장만","meaning":"张，枚，纸","explanation":"장：张，枚，纸；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"장","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29607","senseId":"1","lemma":"장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장만","audio":"/audio/ce48518c2dc1c993ee8b.mp3"}},{"text":"주실","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주실","audio":"/audio/00ef51f0814b98d6d743.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7de567c19a8f64b2","term":"메모지","zh":"便签纸，便笺","audio":"/audio/7de567c19a8f64b2a3c3.mp3","entryId":"55527","definition":"用于记录便条的纸；或写有简单的文字记录的纸。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"多个中的一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"2dfdb434387c361c","term":"장","zh":"张，枚，纸","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3","entryId":"29607","definition":"计算纸张、照片等薄而宽的东西的数量单位。","pronunciation":["장"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a59c8d4abe6613976719.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55527-1-6-2","ko":"물론이죠. 볼펜도 빌려 드릴까요?","zh":"当然可以。需要笔的话我也借给您吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물론이죠.","meaning":"当然，不用说","explanation":"물론：当然，不用说；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"물론","audio":"/audio/86ee58f45cccde9947f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89812","senseId":"1","lemma":"물론","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물론이죠","audio":"/audio/951db0b0bc495a3968bd.mp3"}},{"text":"볼펜도","meaning":"圆珠笔","explanation":"볼펜：圆珠笔；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"볼펜","audio":"/audio/4ba73c1f13e77796fb2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59469","senseId":"1","lemma":"볼펜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼펜도","audio":"/audio/c821a774412906f6d664.mp3"}},{"text":"빌려","meaning":"借","explanation":"빌리다：借；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌려","audio":"/audio/67cc0fe84cbb6a7195bd.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴까요?","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴까요","audio":"/audio/235c96fe68d709255264.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86ee58f45cccde99","term":"물론","zh":"当然，不用说","audio":"/audio/86ee58f45cccde9947f0.mp3","entryId":"89812","definition":"没有必要说的。","pronunciation":["물론"]},{"id":"4ba73c1f13e77796","term":"볼펜","zh":"圆珠笔","audio":"/audio/4ba73c1f13e77796fb2e.mp3","entryId":"59469","definition":"笔尖的小钢珠随着笔的移动一起滚动、同时带出墨水来写字的一种书写工具。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"59252","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bfc578a325bc6531d0f6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55527","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":69,"sequenceScore":1.8367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["当然可以。需要笔的话我也借给您吧？","能给我一张便签纸吗？","这本书的这部分要保留下来吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["能给我一张便签纸吗？","这本书的这部分要保留下来吗？","当然可以。需要笔的话我也借给您吧？"],"answer":2}]}
